---
// Componente About Us basado en la plantilla SEOAI
---
<section style="background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; padding: 100px 0; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;">
    <div style="max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 60px; align-items: center;">
        
        <!-- Columna Izquierda: Imagen y tarjeta flotante -->
        <div style="position: relative;">
            <div style="border-radius: 24px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); background: #e2e8f0; height: 480px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                <!-- Imagen simulada o espacio para la foto de la persona trabajando en ordenador -->
                <div style="width: 100%; height: 100%; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #cbd5e1 0%, #94a3b8 100%); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: #475569; font-weight: 600; font-size: 18px;">
                    [ Imagen: Persona trabajando con gráficos ]
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Tarjeta Flotante de Reseña -->
            <div style="position: absolute; bottom: -30px; left: 30px; background: #ffffff; padding: 25px; border-radius: 20px; box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); width: 300px; border: 1px solid #f1f5f9;">
                <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 12px;">
                    <div>
                        <h4 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0;">43.179 <span style="color: #6366f1; font-size: 16px;">↗</span></h4>
                        <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;">Customer Revenue</p>
                    </div>
                    <div style="display: flex;">
                        <span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #cbd5e1; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                        <span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #94a3b8; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-left: -10px;"></span>
                        <span style="width: 28px; height: 28px; background: #64748b; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; margin-left: -10px;"></span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div style="border-top: 1px solid #f1f5f9; padding-top: 12px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;">
                    <span style="color: #fbbf24; font-size: 14px;">★★★★★ <strong style="color: #0f172a;">4.9/5</strong></span>
                    <span style="font-size: 12px; color: #64748b;">Trusted By <b>58,900+</b> Users</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Columna Derecha: Textos y Características -->
        <div>
            <span style="color: #6366f1; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;">About Us</span>
            
            <h2 style="font-size: 42px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.2; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 20px; letter-spacing: -0.5px;">
                Dedicated to Growing Your Digital Presence
            </h2>
            
            <p style="font-size: 16px; color: #475569; line-height: 1.6; margin-bottom: 30px;">
                We help businesses strengthen their online visibility through data-driven SEO strategies, quality content, and technical optimization.
            </p>

            <!-- Contadores en línea -->
            <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 20px; margin-bottom: 30px; padding-bottom: 30px; border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
                <div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">25<span style="color: #6366f1;">+</span></h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;">Projects Successfully Completed</p>
                </div>
                <div>
                    <h3 style="font-size: 36px; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 0 0 5px 0;">98<span style="color: #6366f1;">%</span></h3>
                    <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin: 0;">Client Satisfaction Rate</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Lista de Características y Botón -->
            <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 20px;">
                <ul style="list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;">
                    <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">
                        <span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 2px solid #6366f1; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"></span>
                        On-Page SEO Optimization
                    </li>
                    <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">
                        <span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 2px solid #6366f1; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"></span>
                        Technical SEO Optimization
                    </li>
                    <li style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b;">
                        <span style="width: 18px; height: 18px; border: 2px solid #6366f1; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;"></span>
                        Internal Linking Strategy
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div>
                    <a href="/about" style="background: #6366f1; color: white; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 30px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);">
                        More About Us
                        <span style="background: white; width: 24px; height: 24px; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block;"></span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>